PART 4: CARTAN DECOMPOSITION OF ATTENTION
------------------------------------------------------------

  CARTAN DECOMPOSITION of attention matrix A:
    A = A_anti + A_sym_tl + scalar·I

  Standard attention:
    ||A_anti|| = 0.2519  (tournament = directional)
    ||A_sym||  = 1.0072  (cooperation = symmetric)
    scalar     = 0.0574  (uniform attention = 1/n)
    anti/sym   = 0.2501

  Quaternion attention:
    ||A_anti|| = 0.0808  (tournament)
    ||A_sym||  = 0.9501  (cooperation)
    scalar     = 0.1466
    anti/sym   = 0.0850

  At n=16: dim(so(n))/dim(p) = 120/135
    = 0.8889
    (approaches 1 for large n, = 2/3 only at n=4)

